<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--The following translations were generated by https://www.deepl.com/-->
  <!-- EN: Beast Master -->
  <GBKT_BeastMaster.degreeDatas.Beast_Master.label>野兽大师</GBKT_BeastMaster.degreeDatas.Beast_Master.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} forms a strong working bond with animals, causing them to trust {PAWN_pronoun} immensely and vigorously follow pronoun's every command. -->
  <GBKT_BeastMaster.degreeDatas.Beast_Master.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 与动物建立了牢固的工作纽带，使它们对 {PAWN_pronoun} 极为信任，并会积极响应该角色的每一条命令。</GBKT_BeastMaster.degreeDatas.Beast_Master.description>
  <!-- EN: Blabbermouth -->
  <GBKT_Blabbermouth.degreeDatas.Blabbermouth.label>多嘴鬼</GBKT_Blabbermouth.degreeDatas.Blabbermouth.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} likes to snoop and gossip about everyone all the time... every day... every hour. It is impossible for the others on the map to not know everyone else's best (and worst) secrets. -->
  <GBKT_Blabbermouth.degreeDatas.Blabbermouth.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 喜欢四处打探并八卦每个人的事……每天……每小时。地图上的其他角色根本不可能不知道彼此最隐秘（也是最不堪）的秘密。</GBKT_Blabbermouth.degreeDatas.Blabbermouth.description>
  <!-- EN: Guardian -->
  <GBKT_Bodyguard.degreeDatas.Guardian.label>守护者</GBKT_Bodyguard.degreeDatas.Guardian.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has sworn to always protect those within arms reach. -->
  <GBKT_Bodyguard.degreeDatas.Guardian.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 发誓要永远保护那些在他臂弯之内的同伴。</GBKT_Bodyguard.degreeDatas.Guardian.description>
  <!-- EN: Cheer Leader -->
  <GBKT_CheerLeader.degreeDatas.Cheer_Leader.label>啦啦队长</GBKT_CheerLeader.degreeDatas.Cheer_Leader.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is so cheerful that is is nearly impossible to be upset around {PAWN_pronoun}'s smile. However, being this peppy all the time takes a lot of energy. -->
  <GBKT_CheerLeader.degreeDatas.Cheer_Leader.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 非常开朗，在 {PAWN_pronoun} 的笑容面前，几乎不可能感到不快。不过，一直保持这种活力四射的状态需要消耗大量精力。</GBKT_CheerLeader.degreeDatas.Cheer_Leader.description>
  <!-- EN: Creative Planner -->
  <GBKT_CreativePlanner.degreeDatas.Creative_Planner.label>创意规划师</GBKT_CreativePlanner.degreeDatas.Creative_Planner.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is constantly full of great ideas, but isn't able to execute hem on their own.  {PAWN_pronoun} spends many restless nights dreaming up pronoun's next great plan, though needs the help of Pronoun's friends to achieve them. -->
  <GBKT_CreativePlanner.degreeDatas.Creative_Planner.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 脑子里总是充满绝妙的主意，但无法独自将它们付诸实践。{PAWN_pronoun} 度过了许多辗转反侧的夜晚，构思着自己下一个伟大的计划，不过要实现这些计划，还需要 {PAWN_pronoun} 朋友们的帮助。</GBKT_CreativePlanner.degreeDatas.Creative_Planner.description>
  <!-- EN: Damsel -->
  <GBKT_Damsel.degreeDatas.Damsel.label>少女</GBKT_Damsel.degreeDatas.Damsel.label>
  <!-- EN: When {PAWN_nameDef} is in trouble, the rest of the colony works harder. -->
  <GBKT_Damsel.degreeDatas.Damsel.description>当 {PAWN_nameDef} 陷入困境时，殖民地的其他成员会更加努力地工作。</GBKT_Damsel.degreeDatas.Damsel.description>
  <!-- EN: Fire Brigadier -->
  <GBKT_FireBrigadier.degreeDatas.Fire_Brigadier.label>消防准将</GBKT_FireBrigadier.degreeDatas.Fire_Brigadier.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is very wary of fires and the damage they can do. {PAWN_pronoun} also knows just what to do to stop one. Only {PAWN_pronoun} can prevent colony fires. -->
  <GBKT_FireBrigadier.degreeDatas.Fire_Brigadier.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 对火灾及其可能造成的破坏非常警惕。{PAWN_pronoun} 也深知如何扑灭火灾。只有 {PAWN_pronoun} 才能防止殖民地发生火灾。</GBKT_FireBrigadier.degreeDatas.Fire_Brigadier.description>
  <!-- EN: Gibbering -->
  <GBKT_Gibbering.degreeDatas.Gibbering.label>语无伦次</GBKT_Gibbering.degreeDatas.Gibbering.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s babble will lead others down the path to madness. -->
  <GBKT_Gibbering.degreeDatas.Gibbering.description>{PAWN_nameDef}的胡言乱语将把其他人引向疯狂。</GBKT_Gibbering.degreeDatas.Gibbering.description>
  <!-- EN: Melee Commander -->
  <GBKT_MeleeCommander.degreeDatas.Melee_Commander.label>近战指挥官</GBKT_MeleeCommander.degreeDatas.Melee_Commander.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} will always lead the charge into battle at the front lines, and other battlers are inspired by their courage and skill. -->
  <GBKT_MeleeCommander.degreeDatas.Melee_Commander.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 总会在前线率先冲锋陷阵，其勇气与技艺激励着其他战士。</GBKT_MeleeCommander.degreeDatas.Melee_Commander.description>
  <!-- EN: Outrider -->
  <GBKT_Outrider.degreeDatas.Outrider.label>先遣者</GBKT_Outrider.degreeDatas.Outrider.label>
  <!-- EN: Creatures naturally trust {PAWN_nameDef}, making {PAWN_pronoun} good at riding animals and leading animals in a charge. -->
  <GBKT_Outrider.degreeDatas.Outrider.description>生物天生信任 {PAWN_nameDef}，因此 {PAWN_pronoun} 擅长骑乘动物并带领动物发起冲锋。</GBKT_Outrider.degreeDatas.Outrider.description>
  <!-- EN: Play Leader -->
  <GBKT_PlayLeader.degreeDatas.Play_Leader.label>游戏领队</GBKT_PlayLeader.degreeDatas.Play_Leader.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} knows how to make any game truly fun! Under {PAWN_pronoun}, everyone has more fun while playing games, and learns more from them as a result. -->
  <GBKT_PlayLeader.degreeDatas.Play_Leader.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 知道如何让任何游戏都变得真正有趣！在 {PAWN_pronoun} 的带领下，大家在玩游戏时都能获得更多乐趣，并因此学到更多东西。</GBKT_PlayLeader.degreeDatas.Play_Leader.description>
  <!-- EN: Research Assistant -->
  <GBKT_ResearchAssistant.degreeDatas.Research_Assistant.label>研究助理</GBKT_ResearchAssistant.degreeDatas.Research_Assistant.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is very good at finding random bits of information but not so good at piecing it all together, relying on others for the final step. -->
  <GBKT_ResearchAssistant.degreeDatas.Research_Assistant.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 非常擅长搜集零散的信息，但不太擅长将这些信息整合起来，最后一步往往需要依赖他人。</GBKT_ResearchAssistant.degreeDatas.Research_Assistant.description>
  <!-- EN: Spastic Fool -->
  <GBKT_SpasticFool.degreeDatas.Spastic_Fool.label>痉挛傻瓜</GBKT_SpasticFool.degreeDatas.Spastic_Fool.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s crazy and wild antics distract friend and foe alike. -->
  <GBKT_SpasticFool.degreeDatas.Spastic_Fool.description>{PAWN_nameDef}疯狂而狂野的举动，让友军和敌军都分心了。</GBKT_SpasticFool.degreeDatas.Spastic_Fool.description>
  <!-- EN: Sterilizer -->
  <GBKT_Sterilizer.degreeDatas.Sterilizer.label>灭菌器</GBKT_Sterilizer.degreeDatas.Sterilizer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has an obsessive need to keep EVERYTHING. SPOTLESS. No germs allowed! But at least it is easier to treat illness and injuries in such a clean environment. -->
  <GBKT_Sterilizer.degreeDatas.Sterilizer.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 有种强迫症，非要把一切都保持得一尘不染不可。绝不允许有任何细菌！不过，在如此洁净的环境中，至少治疗疾病和伤势会更容易一些。</GBKT_Sterilizer.degreeDatas.Sterilizer.description>
  <!-- EN: Taskmaster -->
  <GBKT_Taskmaster.degreeDatas.Taskmaster.label>任务主管</GBKT_Taskmaster.degreeDatas.Taskmaster.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} hates doing work themselves and prefers to assign burdensome tasks to others. Why do it yourself when you are skilled at leading others to do it for you? -->
  <GBKT_Taskmaster.degreeDatas.Taskmaster.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 讨厌亲力亲为，更喜欢把繁重的任务分配给别人。既然擅长指挥别人代劳，何必自己动手呢？</GBKT_Taskmaster.degreeDatas.Taskmaster.description>
  <!-- EN: Teacher -->
  <GBKT_Teacher.degreeDatas.Teacher.label>老师</GBKT_Teacher.degreeDatas.Teacher.label>
  <!-- EN: Others often go to {PAWN_nameDef} to learn and improve their own skills. {PAWN_pronoun} is so good at passing on knowledge, in fact, that they end up spending all of their time doing so - and nothing else. -->
  <GBKT_Teacher.degreeDatas.Teacher.description>其他人常会去找 {PAWN_nameDef} 学习并提升自己的技能。事实上，{PAWN_pronoun} 在传授知识方面非常擅长，以至于他们最终把所有时间都花在了传授知识上——而无暇顾及其他。</GBKT_Teacher.degreeDatas.Teacher.description>
</LanguageData>